# ---- Research outputs (ORGANIZATION.md, "Outputs and importance") ----
# Everything in research/<module>/outputs/ is ignored except MANIFEST.csv, TIDY_LOG.md and the key / product files
# (<= 10 MB) listed in the generated block, which research/common/outputs.py rewrites from the MANIFESTs.
# So diag / scratch outputs (and products over 10 MB) are never committed.
research/*/outputs/**/*.*
!research/*/outputs/MANIFEST.csv
!research/*/outputs/TIDY_LOG.md
